    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "用硬件断点追踪 PostgreSQL 的内部变量",
      "summary": "Jan Kristof Nidzwetzki 演示了用硬件断点而不是 uprobe 追踪 PostgreSQL。做法是让 CPU 监视某个内存地址，被访问时触发 eBPF 程序，不必替换指令，适合盯高频访问的变量。文中的例子是用 bpftrace 的 watchpoint 探针盯住事务 ID 生成用的 nextXid，每次写入就打印进程号和新值。他测得硬件断点约有三成开销、uprobe 约三成八，两者都因 CPU 模式切换而不便宜。",
      "url": "https://jnidzwetzki.github.io/2026/05/08/ebpf-hw-breakpoints-postgresql.html",
      "author": "Jan Kristof Nidzwetzki",
      "source": "jnidzwetzki.github.io",
      "source_date": "2026-05-08",
      "image": "https://jnidzwetzki.github.io//assets/img/header/header1.jpeg",
      "domain": "pg",
      "tags": [
        "eBPF",
        "观测",
        "调试"
      ],
      "position": 4
